    "created_at": "2023-04-04T17:59:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-04T17:59:37Z",
    "body": "Thanks Scott, I am working on that bug right now.\r\nI believe that this spec PR is about a different use case though. Your bug is about having a dialog popover like this:\r\n```html\r\n<dialog popover=auto>\r\n  <button>button</button>\r\n</dialog>\r\n```\r\nThis spec PR is about having a dialog or popover inside a popover like this:\r\n```html\r\n<div popover=auto>\r\n  <div popover=auto>\r\n    <button autofocus>button</button>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <dialog>\r\n    <button autofocus>button</button>\r\n  </dialog>\r\n</div>",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
